    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Every door you knock on owes you an answer.</em></p><p>When you successfully deliver a Message, you may accept a <strong>Reply</strong> as a free action. The Reply becomes your next Message automatically and fills your Package slot immediately upon delivery (Surge still banks to full from the just-completed delivery).</p><p>The recipient is <strong>obligated to provide a Reply</strong> if they wish to fully benefit from the delivery you just made — they may decline, but doing so withdraws the L1 delivery effect (no Surge refill, no Intrigue marks) and any L11 Package Mastery bonus.</p><p>You may decline to carry a Reply. You usually shouldn't.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
